section: compiler
synopsis: :ghc-flag:`-dynamic` no longer turns off :ghc-flag:`-split-sections`.
issues: #TODO
mrs: !TODO

description: {
  Previously, :ghc-flag:`-dynamic` unset :ghc-flag:`-split-sections` at the
  point it was parsed, so ``-split-sections -dynamic`` compiled without split
  sections while ``-dynamic -split-sections`` split. Both orders now keep split
  sections. On platforms that use subsections-via-symbols (e.g. Darwin),
  :ghc-flag:`-split-sections` is still ignored with a warning, as before.

  ``GHC.Platform.Ways.wayUnsetGeneralFlags`` has been removed from the ``ghc``
  library, since no way unsets any flags any more.
}
